---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Terms of Service" description="Terms of Service for PPCDentist.com and its associated services.">

  <section class="bg-brand-slate py-16">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <p class="text-brand-teal text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-3">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-800 text-white">Terms of Service</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-8">Last updated: January 1, 2026</p>
      <div class="space-y-8 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm">

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-700 text-brand-dark mb-3">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
          <p>By accessing and using ppcdentist.com, you accept and agree to be bound by these Terms of Service and our Privacy Policy. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use our website or services.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-700 text-brand-dark mb-3">2. Services</h2>
          <p>PPCDentist, LLC provides digital marketing services including Google Ads management, HIPAA-compliant call tracking, website form solutions, and education-based lead generation for dental practices. Specific service terms are outlined in individual service agreements.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-700 text-brand-dark mb-3">3. Intellectual Property</h2>
          <p>All content on this website, including text, graphics, logos, and images, is the property of PPCDentist, LLC and is protected by applicable intellectual property laws. You may not reproduce or distribute any content without our express written permission.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-700 text-brand-dark mb-3">4. Disclaimer</h2>
          <p>The information on this website is provided for general informational purposes only. Results described are representative examples and are not guaranteed. Individual results will vary based on practice location, competition, budget, and other factors.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-700 text-brand-dark mb-3">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>PPCDentist, LLC shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of this website or our services. Our liability is limited to the amount paid for services in the 3 months prior to any claim.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-700 text-brand-dark mb-3">6. Governing Law</h2>
          <p>These Terms shall be governed by the laws of the State of New Jersey, without regard to its conflict of law provisions.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-700 text-brand-dark mb-3">7. Contact</h2>
          <p>Questions about these Terms should be directed to <a href="mailto:david@ppcdentist.com" class="text-brand-red">david@ppcdentist.com</a> or <a href="tel:9734009004" class="text-brand-red">(973) 400-9004</a>.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
